Translation patch: RistrettoPoint::double_and_compress_batch

Change: the two `map`/`collect`s become `for` loops; the final `zip`/`map` becomes a range loop with indexed borrows (closure body unchanged).
Why: Aeneas only models `Iterator::next` (aeneas#1057).
Behaviour: identical.
Relies on: `invs` has one entry per state and `invert_batch_alloc` takes `&mut [FieldElement]`, so it keeps the length `states.len()`.

